  "description": "“Virlyn” is a breathtaking modern display serif typeface that epitomizes luxury and high-art elegance. Characterized by its high-contrast strokes and exceptionally dramatic alternate stylistic features, this font radiates a sense of premium craftsmanship and professional grace. Its standout elements include expansive, sweeping swashes and intricate circular flourishes that extend far beyond the letterforms, making the text appear as a custom piece of calligraphic art.\nVirlyn will perfect for many project: book, magazines, logo, branding, photography, quotes, blog header, poster, advertisements, etc.\nFeature\nUppercase\nLowercase\nNumeral\nFunctional\nMultilingual\nStylistic\nLigature\nFile include\nOpentype (Otf)\nTruType (Ttf)\nWoff",
  "fullDescription": "<p>“Virlyn” is a breathtaking modern display serif typeface that epitomizes luxury and high-art elegance. Characterized by its high-contrast strokes and exceptionally dramatic alternate stylistic features, this font radiates a sense of premium craftsmanship and professional grace. Its standout elements include expansive, sweeping swashes and intricate circular flourishes that extend far beyond the letterforms, making the text appear as a custom piece of calligraphic art.</p>\n<p>Virlyn will perfect for many project: book, magazines, logo, branding, photography, quotes, blog header, poster, advertisements, etc.</p>\n<p>Feature</p>\n<p>Uppercase<br>\nLowercase<br>\nNumeral<br>\nFunctional<br>\nMultilingual<br>\nStylistic<br>\nLigature<br>\nFile include</p>\n<p>Opentype (Otf)<br>\nTruType (Ttf)<br>\nWoff</p>",
